note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"824fdc45d800b7dd\" href=\"?note=824fdc45d800b7dd\" title=\"67-df-robinson-arithmetic\">67-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fa3acf328238c71\" href=\"?note=5fa3acf328238c71\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions\">67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f115352299e944bf\" href=\"?note=f115352299e944bf\" title=\"67-df-pr-graph-interface\">67-df-pr-graph-interface</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Lemma 1(a),(d)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"15–16"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"26–27"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述有限代入推导已复核；复杂度保持使用所引固定PR图公式构造，未独立重建该表示构造或作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 为 Robinson 算术；取本册强原始递归句法编号和数词代入函数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v]\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v]\\)</span> 是输入算术公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha(t)\">\\(\\alpha(t)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha[t/v]\">\\(\\alpha[t/v]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 表示上述固定自然原始递归句法编号；句法对象与自然数编码、对象语言数词分别使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n\\}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n\\}\\)</span>；公式类及其固定 PR 函数图的定义扩张闭包取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>，不把任意逐数正确的图公式当作该构造。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,v\">\\(x,v\\)</span> 是互异变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi(x,v)\">\\(\\chi(x,v)\\)</span> 的自由变量包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{x,v\\}\">\\(\\{x,v\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\)</span> 在下式构造。数词实例均采用无捕获代入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi(\\bar k,\\overline{g(\\xi(\\bar k))})\">\\(\\chi(\\bar k,\\overline{g(\\xi(\\bar k))})\\)</span> 的第二个参数是该数词实例的编码之数词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的句法编号精确取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_L\">\\(g=c_L\\)</span>（算术语言时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=L_A\">\\(L=L_A\\)</span>）；数词代入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"5fa3acf328238c71\" href=\"?note=5fa3acf328238c71\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions\">67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions</a> 的对应程序，图公式使用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\gamma\">\\(D,\\gamma\\)</span> 固定满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"f115352299e944bf\" href=\"?note=f115352299e944bf\" title=\"67-df-pr-graph-interface\">67-df-pr-graph-interface</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span>；所有层级闭包均以程序图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_e\">\\(\\delta_e\\)</span> 为实例，不对外延函数进行未定义的有效选择。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\coloneqq\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\coloneqq\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\nQ\\vdash\\bigl(\\theta\\leftrightarrow\\alpha(\\overline{g(\\theta)})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\nQ\\vdash\\bigl(\\theta\\leftrightarrow\\alpha(\\overline{g(\\theta)})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\Gamma\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\nQ\\vdash\\bigl(\\theta\\leftrightarrow\\alpha(\\overline{g(\\theta)})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\in\\Gamma\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\nQ\\vdash\\bigl(\\theta\\leftrightarrow\\alpha(\\overline{g(\\theta)})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi\\in\\Gamma\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nQ\\vdash\\bigl(\\xi(\\bar k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\chi(\\bar k,\\overline{g(\\xi(\\bar k))})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi\\in\\Gamma\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nQ\\vdash\\bigl(\\xi(\\bar k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\chi(\\bar k,\\overline{g(\\xi(\\bar k))})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Lemma 1.1(a),(d), pp.15–16（PDF 26–27）。保留一般固定点，并补出本册 Gödel/Rosser 的复杂度及第3章数词参数自指实际使用的两个版本。</p>\n<p>一般版本：令 d(n) 编码把第 n 个一元公式自身编码的数词代入该公式。取原书固定构造的函数图 D(x,z)，令 δ(x)=∃z(D(x,z)∧α(z))，θ=δ(⌜δ⌝)。逐数函数图表示给出 Q⊢∀z(D(⌜δ⌝,z)↔z=⌜θ⌝)，故 Q⊢θ↔α(⌜θ⌝)。PR 函数图的定义扩张和数词代入均属于所引 Γ 的闭包，因而 α∈Γ 时 δ、θ 仍属于 Γ；这一步不能仅凭任意逐数正确的表示推出。</p>\n<p>逐数参数版本：令 b(a,c) 编码将数词 ā 与 c̄ 同时代入二元公式码 c 的两个指定自由变量，并在非法码输入上取固定默认值；它在自然句法编号下是 PR 函数。取同一构造的图 B(x,y,z)，令 η(x,y)=∃z(B(x,y,z)∧χ(x,z))，ξ(x)=η(x,⌜η⌝)。对每个标准 k，逐数函数图表示给出 Q⊢∀z(B(k̄,⌜η⌝,z)↔z=⌜ξ(k̄)⌝)，即 Assertion 第三式，且闭包保持 Γ。外部 ∀k 不被偷换成 Q 内的一次全称证明；原书 Lemma 1.1(e) 的 PA 内统一版本不是这里的断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"824fdc45d800b7dd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions","status":"resolved","id":"5fa3acf328238c71","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-pr-graph-interface","status":"resolved","id":"f115352299e944bf","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-pr-graph-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q$ 为 Robinson 算术；取本册强原始递归句法编号和数词代入函数，见 [[67-df-godel-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v]$ 是输入算术公式；$\\alpha(t)$ 表示 $\\alpha[t/v]$；$\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 见 [[67-df-sentence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","