":false},{"tex":"\\delta_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\coloneqq\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\nQ\\vdash\\bigl(\\theta\\leftrightarrow\\alpha(\\overline{g(\\theta)})\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\Gamma\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\nQ\\vdash\\bigl(\\theta\\leftrightarrow\\alpha(\\overline{g(\\theta)})\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi\\in\\Gamma\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nQ\\vdash\\bigl(\\xi(\\bar k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\chi(\\bar k,\\overline{g(\\xi(\\bar k))})\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":4322,"backlinks":[{"id":"6367025c1515b676","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"83d3bbcffd824285","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1198a516f2c400b1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$；固定点见 [[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]。下式所有箭头内的表达式均为对象语言句法构造，外层 $\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash$ 为元语言可推导性。"},{"id":"bb9a1d5e360bf758","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"87f4e115bf0f1121","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_T$ 见 [[67-df-consistency-statement]]；标准 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 满足 [[67-df-provability-conditions]] 的 $\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)$。固定点与 PA 分别见 [[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]、[[67-df-PA]]。"},{"id":"407cbcc3fb925fed","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$；自然编号和固定点见 [[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]。"},{"id":"fbcaa556e59d96b1","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"源证明对每个 $T$ 公理的有限合取 $\\chi$，有效取 $Q+\\chi$ 的 Gödel 固定点 $G_\\chi$（[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]、[[67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness]]）。一致性给出 $Q+\\chi\\nvdash G_\\chi$，故逻辑不能证明 $\\chi\\to G_\\chi$。原书 Theorem2.4 的内部推导给 $\\mathrm{PA}+\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}\\vdash G_\\chi$；Corollary1.8 的本质反身性又给 $T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}$，因此 $T\\vdash G_\\chi$。将 $\\chi\\mapsto G_\\chi$ 代入 [[67-lem-irredundant-axiomatization-criterion]] 得结果；若理论有限，则可合取后删除冗余，直接有结论。"},{"id":"7cb4b381ccf9d5bd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8e071baceea3f74c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)$ 取 [[67-df-local-reflection]]；$\\mathrm{EssInfinite}(T,S)$ 取 [[67-df-bounded-axiomatizability]]。固定点使用 [[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]。"},{"id":"438750d9f2566c57","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的编号与 [[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]] 的固定点接口；递归集合在 Q 中逐数双表示取 [[67-lem-recursive-predicate-representability]]。"},{"id":"9a6819cbf817140e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{U,\\Gamma}$ 见 [[67-df-partial-truth-definition]]，$\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}$ 为至多自由变量 $v$ 的公式集合；取自然编号并使用 [[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-PA]]；[[../67-df-numeration]]；[[../67-df-arithmetical-classes]]；[[../67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization]]；[[../67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]"}],"outgoing":["e5654af7c954e1c0","854772391cef4007","851cd80e64893935","824fdc45d800b7dd","a329235da6144513","5fa3acf328238c71","f115352299e944bf"]}